# TIP-054.4b-R27 consolidated verification

2026-10-10 · Contractor/Main · **Real-path local continuation accepted; wider R27 PARTIAL / NOT_READY.**

The approved host-owned broker and separately disclosed platform audit boundary
remain implemented. This continuation adds actual finite-child UNIX IPC, genuine
parser/service composition and original-source logging/controller bridges inside
the same R27. No new micro-TIP or serving activation follows this local acceptance.
R21 SLA FAILED/P1, EXE-009 OPEN/P1, candidate NOT_READY, executor OFF and
TIP-054.5 BLOCKED remain unchanged. No product latency repair is claimed.

