## Delivered and frozen

Implementation: `v2/experiments/action_executor/r27/real_path`.
Original product204 and test/helper192 files, dependencies and prior sealed
source/candidates/reviews remain unchanged.

**C1 — actual broker transport and lifecycle.** Authenticated bounded UNIX IPC
from the pinned finite child routes complete write/LogRecord frames to the sole
host writer. No artifact root or descriptor is exported. Shape/token/sequence,
partial/oversize, storage faults and genuine lost ACK after charge reject without
refund/replay. Creator ownership, stale immutable snapshots and cached iterator
steps are guarded; native-fspath access denies. Four client tasks, 4MiB frames,
2MiB raw/snapshot limits and one retained server join bound cooperative operation.
Socket identity is validated and unlinked before lease release; unresolved cleanup
retains HOLD. First producer fault remains sticky and preserves exception identity.

The actual finite child control is five seconds, not a 190-second load. Child/server
share the first absolute ten-second cleanup deadline. Concurrent bounded whole-EOF
stdout/stderr drains, observed PID absence and named owned task absence are checked
before event-loop shutdown, including overflow/repeated cancellation. This is not
Linux process-group/descendant proof, hostile same-UID/native-FD isolation or a
universal sandbox. Native socket path-length and sandbox permission failures remain
retained; the final admitted local test uses a bounded repository-relative socket.

**C2 — genuine composition.** Full original signed fixture executes five files/six
write attempts and genuine PackageParser through generation-checked logical snapshots.
Actual SOTPublishService construction and inherited method/factory identity are
checked; only parser storage is replaced. Stage/validate/publish SQL methods are
not called. Unsafe/missing/extra/corrupt/schema/signature/expiry/curator controls run.
Lower-parameter line/schema controls do not certify exhaustive production-max boundaries.

**C3 — source-conserved driver and logging.** Complete original driver/baseline ASTs
are recoverable unchanged after removing four explicit storage/context bindings
and one readiness call. Nested runpy, argv, seed and code objects are prepared;
every full execution entry self-DENY before imports/effects. Whole rendered root,
audit and httpx-style LogRecords preserve formatter/terminator bytes. Logger/global
state restores, including genuine cold-created logger identities and failure lock
release. Exact original oracle source/code/line plus complete summary/stdout/sample
state separates legitimate integrity-valid SLA FAIL from arbitrary Exit1 or caught
producer fault. No HTTP observations or scheduling-equivalence claim follows.

**C4 — concrete controller endpoints.** Actual correct pinned R21 e1 copy bytes,
shell literal, returncode line, exclusive local control marker and original R19
persisted cleanup deadline execute. Full native commands/Linux routines are only
source-prepared. Pytest JUnit XML and Alembic fileConfig writer seams remain
UNSUPPORTED_BEFORE_DISPATCH; unexpected native/warnings/tracebacks deny.
Local control markers are not future campaign markers.

**C5 — frozen evidence.** Four codec/four writer byte substitutions, identical
interface stub and real-return/interface checks pass. Codec implementation body
is not strict-type/style body-audited; historical errors are retained.
Identity is HEAD `0e88f48588dc3228f1ae9eca7a7597d96589af8b` plus frozen
dirty source bytes, not a new commit or deployed runtime.

